Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] The reusable probe is stored at `scripts/rebar_duration_probe.py`.\n- [x] Source contains no literal machine-specific user-home or worktree path.\n- [x] The documented command reproduces the frozen provider-clean window.\n- [x] `--current-since 2026-08-22T00:00:00Z` selects the frozen current-regime cohort.\n- [x] No-LLM operations remain distinguishable from completed model-backed cohorts.\n- [x] Forced, status/check/help, unmatched, and interrupted operations remain distinguishable from completed model-ba...\n- [x] Gated-close output reports pre-verifier residual, deterministic verifier, LLM verifier, verdict-to-status, stat...\n- [x] Each gated-close phase is labeled as a direct metric, direct event interval, or inferred residual.\n- [x] Focused tests use synthetic fixtures only and pass.\n- [x] The standalone script passes the import-walk check without import-time side effects.\n- [x] Repository guidance remains unchanged pending separate operator confirmation.\n[full output: \"$HOME/Library/Application Support/rtk/tee/1787538198_jq_-r__description.log\"]"}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1787538201584939001,"uuid":"7d8cadd0-3bf5-46d2-a254-e2feb8fb434a"}